****************************************************************

****************************************************************
SUM
****************************************************************
SELECT SUM(A) FROM aggrtable;
SELECT SUM(ALL A) FROM aggrtable;
13
SELECT SUM(DISTINCT A) FROM aggrtable;
10

SELECT SUM(B) FROM aggrtable;
SELECT SUM(ALL B) FROM aggrtable;
SELECT SUM(DISTINCT B) FROM

aggrtable;
NULL

SUM: The SUM function returns the total sum of a numeric column.
SUM(column_name) adds up non-NULL values in a specific column, and 
SUM(DISTINCT column_name) adds up distinct non-NULL values.
